      "value": "Use the provided start image as the first frame. The person is ALREADY walking toward the camera down the center of the colonnade in a precise, confident \"runway walk\", one foot placed in front of the other, gaze locked on a point just past the camera, and never breaks stride. With every step a perfect clone separates from their body, one to the left, then one to the right, each clone in the same red trench coat with the same face and hair, and every clone walks in exact lockstep, the same foot landing at the same instant. By the end of the shot exactly SEVEN identical copies of the person walk toward the camera together in a V formation, the original at the point of the V and three clones fanned out behind on each side, all perfectly synchronized. CLONE COUNT LOCK: seven figures in the final frame; any other number = failed take. The camera tracks backward at walking pace, keeping the formation centered. Sound: each clone separates with a soft airy whoosh, and the footsteps multiply into one sharp synchronized rhythm echoing off the concrete. Photorealistic, cinematic fashion-film visual effects, consistent identity across every clone, sharp detail, stable picture."
